BUG#25 + BUG#26 — wizard CLI English + url field + Custom tag
Verified on VM (vm-test, michal-VirtualBox), 2026-05-11.

User feedback that motivated these:
  - "Opisy modeli są ręczne — co jeśli się zdezaktualizują?" → BUG#25:
    replace free-form `description` with a `url` to ollama.com/library,
    let the Library page own the copy.
  - "Skrypt powinien być po angielsku" → matches the existing convention
    for tools/ CLIs (tasks, consult, memory_wizard); GTK dialogs in BT
    proper keep gettext localisation.
  - "Co jeśli ktoś będzie miał mocniejszy komputer?" → BUG#26: add a
    'c' / Custom tag entry so workstation users (Llama 70B class) can
    pull any Ollama tag without waiting for the bundled catalog to
    catch up.

Code changes:
  bterminal/providers/aider_models.json
    - bumped schema_version 1 → 2
    - removed `description` from every entry
    - added `url` pointing at https://ollama.com/library/<tag>
  tools/aider_setup_wizard
    - all user-facing strings → English (matches tools/ convention)
    - title col renamed Opis → Info; cell uses rich [link={url}]details[/link]
      (OSC-8 hyperlink — VTE renders as underlined clickable text)
    - pick_model() accepts 'c' in addition to numeric + 'r'
    - +prompt_custom_tag() — Prompt.ask("Custom model tag") +
      synthetic dict (tag, label, url derived from base name,
      ram_gb=0, download_mb=0, tier="custom")
    - main() loops back to render_table on 'r' (refresh) AND on 'c'
      (only when the user cancels the custom prompt)
  tests/test_aider_probe.py
    - required-keys assertion: `description` → `url`
    - added schema-v2 guard: `description` must NOT be present
    - added URL prefix guard: must start with https://ollama.com/library/
  tests/test_aider_setup_wizard_cli.py
    - retired Polish substring check (used "Model already pulled" / English)
    - +test_prompt_custom_tag_builds_synthetic_model_entry
    - +test_prompt_custom_tag_empty_input_returns_none

